    "description": "The Twinkly App is packed with unique features that let you control and manage your devices, play and customize effects, and design your own.\r\n\r\n- Map your lights to play, customize and create effects.\r\n- Group devices, create installations and assign user roles.\r\n- Set timers and create playlists.\r\n- Adjust brightness.\r\n- Connect to Amazon Alexa or Google Assistant for hands-free voice control.\r\n- Sync lights to sounds and music with Twinkly Music.",
